@startuml uc-authentication
'==============================================================================
' Detailed use cases: Authentication, shared identically by every user role.
' Standard arrangement: actors LEFT, use cases in the boundary MIDDLE.
' The single "Client User" actor stands for the 4 tenant roles (Admin,
' Legal Manager, Approver, Auditor) -- authentication is identical for each,
' so drawing them separately would only multiply identical edges.
' Colour legend (this diagram contains an out-of-scope actor):
' RED = out of the project's scope; YELLOW = in scope.
' Render:  make figures
'==============================================================================
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ranksep 120
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor      #34495E
  BackgroundColor  #FDFEFE
  ArrowColor       #5D6D7E
}
skinparam actor {
  BorderColor      #34495E
}

actor "Super Admin" as sa #E74C3C
actor "Client User" as cu #F1C40F

note bottom of cu
  Client User stands for the
  4 tenant roles: Admin,
  Legal Manager, Approver
  and Auditor; authentication
  is identical for each.
end note

rectangle "Authentication" {
  usecase "Authenticate\n(password + email OTP)" as UC_auth
  usecase "Verify second factor\n(email OTP)"    as UC_mfa
  usecase "Reset password"                       as UC_reset
  usecase "Accept invitation"                    as UC_acceptinv
}

sa -- UC_auth
sa -- UC_reset
cu -- UC_auth
cu -- UC_reset
cu -- UC_acceptinv

UC_auth ..> UC_mfa : <<include>>

note bottom of UC_mfa
  Mandatory for Admin and
  Super Admin, offered to all
end note

@enduml
